                <mxCell id="notest" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#5A4A10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;b&gt;Binding constraints&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color:#5A4A10&quot;&gt;1.&amp;nbsp; The new system uses the existing database tables without any modification.&lt;br/&gt;2.&amp;nbsp; Existing stored procedures are reused as-is, to keep data consistent and avoid a performance hit.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;What that means for generated code: procedure-call DAOs with explicit result-set row mappers. No JPA entity scaffolding, no Flyway or Liquibase migrations.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="100" width="1440" x="62" y="1210" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="tsp" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;html=1;fillColor=#F2F6FD;strokeColor=#1F3C88;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#F58534;" value="" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="422" width="380" x="1560" y="240" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="tspbar" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#1F3C88;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=16;verticalAlign=middle;" value="Target State" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="40" width="380" x="1560" y="240" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="tspb" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1A1A1A;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(22, 41, 106);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; Angular UI for a richer customer experience, hosted on&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(22, 41, 106);&quot;&gt;S3 with CloudFront as the CDN.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; API Gateway exposes the APIs and handles&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(22, 41, 106);&quot;&gt;authentication and authorisation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; Backend services built with Spring Boot,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(22, 41, 106);&quot;&gt;deployed as ECS containers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; The existing MS SQL database stays as the data store&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(22, 41, 106);&quot;&gt;, with S3 for documents.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;5.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; Cross-cutting cloud and platform services.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;6.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; Integration with internal systems, event-based&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(22, 41, 106);&quot;&gt;or request-response.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; Code deployment automated through the DevOps pipeline.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;8.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; Internal teams drop configuration files into the S3 bucket.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;9.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; Spring Batch jobs run and update MS SQL tables.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="380" width="338" x="1582" y="300" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
