                <mxCell id="ovn" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1A1A1A;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 73, 102);&quot;&gt;This plane is separate from the runtime above, which runs on the existing MS SQL database. The FastAPI variant deploys the integration layer as an ECS service, which brings an ALB target group, an API Gateway route, Okta scopes and autoscaling with it. Either way the artifacts land in the same Bedrock&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 73, 102);&quot;&gt;and RDS PostgreSQL store, and GATHER-telemetry reports on both.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
