                <mxCell id="t4c14" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F3C88;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" value="ECS: Bedrock IAM task role — no API key or browser login needed&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(183, 28, 28);&quot;&gt;⚡ LANGGRAPH MICRO ↔ Plugins are mutually exclusive:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;FE_RUNNER=bedrock → LangGraph MICRO&amp;nbsp; · Boto 3 - Becrock- claude -Python @tools only&lt;br&gt;FE_RUNNER=auto/cli → Claude CLI- ADLC Plugins&amp;nbsp;" vertex="1">
