                <mxCell id="t4-tools-summary" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E06C1E;strokeWidth=1.2;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;kb_search(query, top_k=8)&lt;/b&gt; — RAG search on KB chunks via pgvector · one query → top-K results (max 20) · used to ground docs in business rules, screens, workflows&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;kb_search_multi(queries, top_k=8)&lt;/b&gt; — batch KB search · 2–5 queries merged + deduplicated in one call · use when synonyms need separate queries&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;read_file(filename)&lt;/b&gt; — read any existing file from the workspace folder · used to inspect a draft before writing&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;write_file(filename, content)&lt;/b&gt; — write stage deliverable (PRD.md, SDD.md…) to workspace · each call overwrites previous version&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;get_upstream_artifact(stage_key)&lt;/b&gt; — read approved output from a prior stage · e.g. stage_key=&#39;frd&#39; → returns approved FRD.md · enables SDD to read FRD + ADR + NFR before writing" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="76" width="1876" x="72" y="1740" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
