                <mxCell id="t6-n1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5A6B85;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="• LangGraph at two levels: MACRO (graph.py StateGraph — pipeline routing, one thread per workspace); MICRO (create_react_agent —&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;Claude turn-by-turn on ECS via Bedrock IAM task role)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="34" width="510" x="1695" y="674" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="t6-n2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5A6B85;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="• FE_RUNNER controls path: FE_RUNNER=bedrock → ECS MICRO path; FE_RUNNER=cli → Laptop Claude Code CLI plugin path.&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;Mutually exclusive per stage.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="34" width="510" x="1695" y="712" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="t6-n3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5A6B85;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="• arch_sync_gate: Global pauses after FRD approval. Architecture Workspace (singleton) runs ADR→NFR→SDD→SRD on laptop&lt;div&gt;. Global resumes via Command(resume) when SRD approved.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="34" width="510" x="1695" y="750" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="t6-n4" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5A6B85;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="• Developer &amp;amp; Test Workspaces read Architecture artefacts via readable_workspace_ids=[architecture].&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;One workspace spawned per EPIC from the EPIC-SET.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="34" width="510" x="1695" y="788" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="t6-n5" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5A6B85;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="• KB Rail: Amazon Bedrock KB is read at the start of every stage (kb_search / MCP) and written&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;at the end (write_file + post-generation KB sync hook).&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;RDS PG stores embeddings + LG checkpoints.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="34" width="510" x="1695" y="826" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
